<p>Stages are used in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Conversation" title="Conversation">conversations</a> that take place in a predefined location. They are like the direction of a stage play, allowing the activities of the conversation's participants and the positioning of the camera to be controlled while the lines are being spoken.
</p><p>The default The "face to face" conversations will occur whenever a stage is not specified for the conversation.
</p>
